# Tailwind class-discovery stats, written by [build] writeStats on every build.
# Untracked as of v0.3.0: it changed on every build, so any local `hugo server`
# run dirtied the tree and blocked the next `git pull`. See AGENTS.md for the
# one consequence (a cold first build drops dynamically-assembled classes until
# the file exists).
